Credits
-------
The Bluetooth protocol facts Liberarr relies on (advertisement format, unlock
handshake, command framing, file header and encryption layout) are documented
in PLAUD_NOTE_PRO_PROTOCOL.md of roopen219/plaude-archiver (MIT licensed).
Liberarr contains no code from that project; it implements the documented
facts independently.
